134-# Bound for the after-terminal pickup wait — POLICY-DRIVEN (env-overridable), NOT a brittle
135-# literal. The pickup signal (plan-rev bump / planning re-entry / first non-user progress past
136-# the baseline seq) is detected correctly but arrives LATE on a slow driver: measured ~37s on
137-# MiniMax-M3 (finalize + replan latency). The old 25s literal therefore ALWAYS timed out, which
